  wtf · first start

  Which of these does your terminal draw cleanly?
  Lines should join up; no character should be a box or a question mark.

                                 ┌────┐    ┌────┐    ┌────┃    ┌────┐    ┌────
                clk   0     ─────┘    └────┘    └────┘    ┃────┘    └────┘
  ▌ 1 unicode               ━━━━━━━━━━🮦───────────────────┃─────────🮦─────────
                data  0x3C  ━━ 0xXX ━━🮧────── 0xA5 ───────┃─ 0x3C ──🮧─ 0xF0 ──

                                 ┌────┐    ┌────┐    ┌────┃    ┌────┐    ┌────
                clk   0     ─────┘    └────┘    └────┘    ┃────┘    └────┘
    2 box                   ━━━━━━━━━━┬───────────────────┃─────────┬─────────
                data  0x3C  ━━ 0xXX ━━┴────── 0xA5 ───────┃─ 0x3C ──┴─ 0xF0 ──

                                 +----+    +----+    +----┃    +----+    +----
                clk   0     -----+    +----+    +----+    ┃----+    +----+
    3 ascii                 ==========+-------------------┃---------+---------
                data  0x3C  == 0xXX ==+------ 0xA5 -------┃- 0x3C --+- 0xF0 --


  1–3 or j k, Enter to pick · Esc for the defaults · wtf --setup asks again
